# DeepGEMM PR check-in caselist for Zhenwu 890P
# Run with: python tests/run_deep_gemm.py --caselist tests/checkin/checkin_890p.list
# Minimal per-type correctness set with 890P-only dtypes (fp8 / fp4).
# W4A16 INT4 and MXFP4 VALU paths are covered on both 810E and 890P.
# W4A16 MXFP4 MMA is additionally covered on 890P.
# MQA coverage focuses on FP8/FP4, plus one BF16 and one INT8 smoke case.
# Eight paged MQA cases total, including avg, sparse, and the INT8 smoke case.
# Sections are split per UT type; append new cases under the matching section.

